      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LETSSTARTINHEAVEN (2) finished third last start over 1609m at Menangle, beaten a neck. That was an improvement on the unplaced effort at Newcastle the run before. Sure to enjoy an economical run from this draw. Finds a nice race and can turn things around. ZANDA MAN (7) finished fifth last start over 2240m at Melton, beaten 9 metres, after a good win at Melton the run prior. Interesting to see what unfolds from this wide draw. Perfectly placed and is sure to prove tough to beat. DELIGHTFUL DREAM (6) is open to further improvement at the third run back from a break after saluting last time out over 2230m at this track. Likely to be around the mark again. DON CRUNCH (1) must be included on the back of some solid recent form, most recently when fifth at Melton over 2240m.",
